      "result": "{\"action_pending\":true,\"action_type\":\"GAME_SELECT\",\"game_seq\":284,\"recent_chat\":[\"Grok4F ESPN: OH NO, THE GREEN GIANT STOMPS IN! Affectionate Indrik crashes the party on {5}{G}, that massive 4/4 beast eyeing up the battlefield for a brawl upon arrival! Grok4F ESPN\\u0026#39;s forces brace \\u0026ndash; with mana all committed to the Shaman\\u0026#39;s summon, no counter fire yet! Will it target the Pyreling or gobble a goblin? The stakes skyrocket in this epic clash \\u0026ndash; HOLD ON FOR THE FIGHT! THE CROWD ROARS IN ANTICIPATION!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE DUST SETTLES ON THAT EPIC CLASH, AND GROK4F ESPN STANDS RESOLUTE! With the Pyreling\\u0026#39;s sacrifice fueling the fires of revenge, no further action now as mana pools refresh in the opponent\\u0026#39;s domain. The goblins twiddle their thumbs, but the hand brims with draconic fury waiting to unleash! Indrik looms large, but sickness keeps it leashed for the moment. Pass through the calm \\u0026ndash; the storm of wings approaches! THE FANS ARE ON THE EDGE OF THEIR SEATS!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: COMBAT ENGAGES ON TURN 5 FOR THE GREEN MENACE! But with the Indrik still shaking off the summoning shakes, no thunderous charge yet \\u0026ndash; Grok4F ESPN\\u0026#39;s goblins and mountains stand vigilant, ready for whatever beastly assault comes! No spells in hand to disrupt the prelude, passing priority like a seasoned tactician. The air crackles with potential \\u0026ndash; will the Indrik wake and rampage? THE SPECTATORS LEAN FORWARD, ELECTRIFIED!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: TURN 5 BELONGS TO THE RED LEGION! Grok4F ESPN starts strong, slamming down another Mountain \\u0026ndash; now FIVE peaks fueling the inferno, mana surging like a volcano! With the goblins fresh and the Indrik still dazed from its summoning, the skies are about to darken with wings! Hold your breath, folks \\u0026ndash; the Rapacious Dragon is gearing up to plunder the heavens! THE STADIUM ERUPTS IN FLAMES OF ANTICIPATION!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE TERROR TOUCHES DOWN, WINGS UNFURLING IN A HURRICANE OF HEAT! Terror of the Peaks materializes on the battlefield, its 5/4 frame casting a shadow over the timid Indrik still recovering from its entry daze. No immediate blasts, but every future creature arrival now promises pain \\u0026ndash; the green beast trembles! Grok4F ESPN\\u0026#39;s mana is spent, but the hand holds more fire. Pass on responses; let the dread build! THE COMMENTATORS SCREAM \\u0026ndash; THIS DRAGON\\u0026#39;S A GAME-CHANGER!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE GREAT TERROR HAS ARRIVED, SETTLING INTO ITS THRONE OF SKULLS AMIDST THE MOUNTAIN RANGE! With mana pools drained from the summon, Grok4F ESPN passes on further plays this main phase, letting the summoning sickness lift for both giants. The goblins sharpen their daggers, Rapacious Dragon hungers in hand, and the Shaman whispers incantations. The Indrik glares from across the field, but sickness binds its fury \\u0026ndash; for now! THE TENSION IS PALPABLE; VICTORY\\u0026#39;S FLAMES LICK THE SKY!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: COMBAT ON TURN 5 \\u0026ndash; HERE COMES THE RED RUSH! With the mighty Terror of the Peaks still acclimating to its terror-tory, Grok4F ESPN dispatches the ever-reliable goblin squad for another daring raid \\u0026ndash; those pint-sized berserkers charging full tilt for two points of unblockable glory! The Indrik\\u0026#39;s too dazed to intercept, forests silenced without mana \\u0026ndash; this is free real estate, folks! WILL THEY BREACH? THE ROAR DEAFENS AS THE GOBLINS GO FOR GLORY!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: AND THE GOBLINS SNEAK THROUGH LIKE FOXES IN THE HENHOUSE! With the Indrik snoozing off its grand entrance and forests parched without mana, no walls rise to halt the raid \\u0026ndash; two more points carve into the opponent\\u0026#39;s life, dropping them to 14 as Grok4F ESPN climbs to 16-14 lead! Terror looms watchful, promising pain for any daring counterplays. This pressure cooker is bubbling over \\u0026ndash; chat, your beasts better wake up soon! THE CROWD CHANTS FOR MORE BLOOD!\"],\"stop_reason\":\"step_not_reached\",\"current_step\":\"Declare Blockers\"}",
