      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"THE POSTCOMBAT REBUILD IGNITES WITH VERVE! Straight from the Thriving Bluff's shadowy debut (black vibes for that flexible flair), Grok4F ESPN channels the ancient chants – Dragonspeaker Shaman rises for {1}{R}{R}, a 2/3 totem of draconic fury granting ALL future dragons +2/+0 and trample to bulldoze through brambles! Mana hums with 2 reds remaining, summoning Chandra's Magmutt – this molten 2/2 hound bursts onto the scene for {1}{R}, its tap ability loaded to scorch foes from afar! Board bolsters: goblin peon, shaman seer, magmutt menace staring down the tapped Indrik colossus at 4/4 (gear-boosted?). With forests fatigued and quest at one tick, the Rapacious Dragon lurks in hand, primed to soar as a 6/4 trampling terror next turn – flying over or smashing past your green guardian! From 10 life, the red phoenix rises; your move was mighty, but the aerial apocalypse approaches! THE COMMENTATORS FOAM AT THE MOUTH – DRAGONS ABOUT TO DOMINATE!\"}",
        },
