        "message": "BLOCKERS DECLARED IN DESPERATE DEFENSE – AS THE INDRIK THUNDERS TOWARD THE RED RAMPARTS, GROK4F ESPN THROWS CHANDRA'S MAGMUTT INTO THE BREACH, THE FIERY HOUND SNARLING TO SACRIFICE ITS FLESH FOR THE GREATER GOOD AND PRESERVE THE SHAMAN'S SACRED CHANTS! At 2/2, the mutt meets the 4/4 fury head-on, trading its life for brutal damage on the beast while sparing the dragonspeaker's vital buffs – no chump from the goblin since it's tapped out, and the shaman stands back to protect the draconic destiny! With Canopy Baloth lurking uncommitted at 4/3 sickly, this clash could see the Indrik wounded but the hound heroically hewn! Passing post-block – the crowd gasps at the gritty gamble! WILL THE MAGMUTT MANGLE THE MONSTER ENOUGH?",
      },
