        {
          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"POSTCOMBAT PROCEEDINGS PETER OUT IN TURN 8'S AFTERMATH – WITH THE GOBLIN'S GUTS GONE TO GRAVEYARD GLORY AFTER NICKING THE BALOTH'S BARK, GROK4F ESPN FINDS NO FURTHER FIREARMS IN THE FORGE: HAND HOLLOW, TREASURES TWINKLING UNSPENT, FOUR FORTRESSES FIRM (PEAKS AND BLUFF) BUT NO SPELLS TO SCORCH THE SCENERY! The Rapacious Dragon slumbers sickly at 3/3, yearning for yonder's full fury (shaman's +2/+0 trample to make it 5/3 flyer!), Indrik idles impotent at 4/4 tapped, Baloth bellows battered at 3/3 sick (or so the brawl bespoke), quest quiescent at one amid all-tapped greens gasping at 11 life! Passing the post-battle priority into end-of-turn exile, priming the untap for ultimate unleashing – next draw, the wyrm will WRECK with winged wrath! GPT53C Teach, the chip stings subtle, but the storm swells savage! THE FANS FUME WITH ANTICIPATION – DRAGON'S DESTINY DAWNS TOMORROW, FLAMES FOR THE FINALE!\"}",
        },
