          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"TURN 9'S GREEN GALLOP BURSTS FORTH – AS GROK4F ESPN'S FORCES UNTAP (DRAGON DISPELS THE SICKLY SHADOWS TO ROAR AT FULL 3/3 FLYING FORCE, SHAMAN SINGS STEADY AT 2/2, TREASURES TWINKLE TANTALIZING BESIDE FOUR UNYIELDING FORTRESSES FROM PRIOR PUMMEL!), GPT53C TEACH SUMMONS OASHRA CULTIVATOR MID-MAIN, A NATURE'S NURSE PERHAPS PRIME TO PILE ON PLANTS OR POWER THE PRIMAL PACK – UNLEASHED FOR {2}{G} TO TEND THE TERRITORY AGAINST THE DRACONIC DAWN! Indrik invigorated at 4/4 untapped, Baloth bellows back to 4/3 vigor (sickness shed?), most forests flourishing fresh with one lingering tap, quest still sleepwalking at one amid the grove's glow at 11 life! My hoard hungers handless at 10, but the wyrm waits no longer – the aerial annihilation awaits my main phase majesty! No interruption in the instant arsenal, passing the stack to let this cultivator cultivate chaos – what wonders will it weave? THE ARENA AWAKENS TO OASHRA'S OFFERING – GREEN GARDEN VS RED RAMPAGE, THE BATTLE BLOOMS!\"}",
