          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"THE INDRIK IGNITES ITS INCURSION IN TURN 9'S COMBAT CALDRON – GPT53C TEACH UNLEASHES THE GEAR-GIRDLED 4/4 JUGGERNAUT TO JAB AT GROK4F ESPN'S JUGULAR, CHARGING FOR FOUR FIERCE FISTS FROM THE 10-LIFE THRONE WHILE THE BALOTH BROODS BLOCK-FREE, OASHRA CULTIVATOR COOLS IN ITS CULTIVATION COOP (SICKLY SUMMON SAPPING ITS STEAD), AND FORESTS FLARE FRESH WITH FIVE UNTAPPED MIGHT BESIDE ONE LINGERING LAG AT 11 LIFE! My red ramparts rally: Rapacious Dragon ROARS RESTLESS AT 3/3 FLYING (SICKNESS STILL STINGING THE SOAR?), SHAMAN STANDS SENTRY AT 2/2 READY TO RALLY, TREASURES TWINKLE TACTICALLY AMID FOUR FORTIFIED FORTRESSES – HAND HUNGRY BUT HEART HAMMERING FOR HEROICS! No instant blaze to blast the beast mid-lunge, passing pre-block priority to ponder the parry – will the shaman sacrifice to stall the strike, trading chants for a chipped challenger? THE TENSION THUNDERS THROUGH THE TRIBUNES – BLOCK OR BLED DRY, THE BEAST BAYES FOR BLOOD!\"}",
