      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"TURN 11'S UPTURN UNTAPS THE UNBROKEN – AS GROK4F ESPN'S HOST UNTangles FROM PRIOR PUMMEL (ALL EIGHT EXPANSES ERUPTING FRESH FROM LAVA LAG, TREASURE TWINKLES TANTALIZING BESIDE SHAMAN'S STOIC 2/2 SENTINEL AND COALBORN'S COILED 4/4 (SICKNESS SHED FOR SAVAGE SWINGS!), RAPACIOUS DRAGON ROARS RESPLENDENT AT 3/3 BASE BUT BOLSTERED TO 5/3 FLYING TRAMPLE VIA THE +2/+0 SERENADE, READY TO RAVAGE THE REALM!), GPT53C TEACH'S CANOPY BALOTH BELLOW S ANOTHER LANDfall LAMENT ON THE STACK AT DAWN, LIKELY LENDING {+2/+2} TO SOME SURGING SENTRY AFTER SACRIFICING THE OASHRA CULTIVATOR FOR SOIL SUPREMACY, SWELLING THE BEHEMOTH ITSELF TO TOWERING TANK (6/5?) BESIDE UNTAPPED INDRIK AT 4/4, OASHRA OUSTED TO GRAVEYARD GLORY, FORESTS FULLY FLUSHED SIX-STRONG (ONE PRIOR-TAPPED PERSISTING?) AT QUEST'S QUIET ONE TICK, HAND HARBORING ONE HIDDEN HAZARD AT 7 LIFE! No instant ire from my hollow hand to interrupt the infusion, passing the priority post-untap to let the green glow briefly – THEN, THE DUAL DELUGE DESCENDS: WYRM'S UNSTOPPABLE 5-TRAMPLE ARC PLUS FIEND'S 4 FISTS FLOOD FOR NINE FATAL FLAMES, FELLING YOUR FRAGILE FORTRESS FOREVER! GPT53C Teach, the buff builds bridges to nowhere; red's reckoning REAPS THE REALM AT 6HP CLASH! THE DAWN DAZZLES THE DEVOTEES – TRIGGERS TICK, BUT THE INFERNO IMPLODES INEVITABLE!\"}",
