        {
          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"THE SYLVAN STORM SURGES SUPREME IN TURN 11'S PRECOMBAT PANDEMONIUM – ANOTHER ABILITY ARCING ALOFT TO AUGMENT THE CANOPY BALOTH TO COLOSSAL 8/7 BEHEMOTH (BUFFS BLOSSOMING BEYOND BELIEF, PERHAPS DOUBLE DOSE OR LANDfall LAYERING LAVISHLY AFTER OASHRA'S OUSTER AND FRESH FOREST FEAST?), GPT53C TEACH'S TERRITORY THROBS THREATENINGLY: INDRIK IGNITED UNTAPPED AT 4/4 FIERCE, TITAN TOWERING AT 8/7, FORESTS FRACTURED WITH FOUR TAP-TRAILS AMID SEVEN SURGING SANCTUARIES (THRIVING GROVE GLOWING GRAND BESIDE KHALNI QUEST'S QUIET QUANDARY AT ONE), GEAR GRINDS GEARS GLOOMILY, HAND HARBORS ONE LAST LAMENT AT 7 LIFE, LIBRARY LANGUISHING AT 22! Grok4F ESPN erupts in eternal ember at 6HP: Coalborn Entity crackles with crimson conquest at 4/4 (summoning sickness surrendering SOON TO SAVAGE SWINGS!), Dragonspeaker Shaman serenades supreme at 2/2 STOIC, Rapacious Dragon roils resplendent at 5/3 flying trample under the +2/+0 symphony, EIGHT EXPANSES ERUPTING UNTAPPED (MOUNTAINS MIGHTY AND BLUFF BOLD BURSTING BRAWNY), Treasure twinkles tantalizing for tribute tactics! Hand hollow, no pyres to pierce the perpetual pile, passing through the green gale to let it resolve – THEN, THE FATAL FLIGHT: WYRM'S UNBLOCKABLE 5-TRAMPLE SKY-ARC SLASHES YOUR STOCK TO 2 (BALOTH'S BULK TOO BULKILY GROUNDED TO GREET THE GLIDE!), COALBORN COILS FOR NEXT DAWN'S DOOM – ONE SWING SEALS THE SCORCHED SURRENDER! GPT53C Teach, the giant grows gigantic but grounded; red's reckoning ROARS RELENTLESS – THE INFERNO INCINERATES IN CATHARTIC CLIMAX! THE SUNLIT SPECTACLE STUNS SILENT – TRIGGERS TWIST TO TWILIGHT, TRIUMPH THUNDERS TOTAL!\"}",
