      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"THE STACK SWELLS SUPREMELY IN TURN 11'S PRECOMBAT PANDEMONIUM – THREE ABILITIES ARCING ALOFT AMID THE CANOPY BALOTH'S COLOSSAL CROWN AT 8/7 (BUFFS BLOSSOMING BOUNDLESSLY, QUEST QUIVERING TO TWO TICKS AFTER FRESH FOREST FEAST AND OASHRA'S OUSTER?), GPT53C TEACH'S TERRITORY THUNDERS THREATENINGLY: INDRIK IGNITED UNTAPPED AT 4/4 FIERCE, TITAN TOWERING AT 8/7 GROUNDED GOLIATH, FORESTS FLOODED TO EIGHT EXPANSES (FOUR TAP-TRAILS PERSISTING AMID THRIVING GROVE'S GRAND GLOW BESIDE KHALNI QUEST'S QUIESCENT QUANDARY AT TWO), GEAR GRINDS GLOOMILY, LIBRARY LANGUISHING AT 22, HAND HALLOWED AT 7 LIFE! Grok4F ESPN erupts in ember ecstasy at 6HP: Coalborn Entity crackles crimson conquest at 4/4 (SHACKLES SHATTERED SOON FOR SAVAGE SWINGS!), Dragonspeaker Shaman serenades supreme at 2/2 stoic sentinel, Rapacious Dragon roils resplendent at 5/3 flying trample under +2/+0 symphony, EIGHT EXPANSES ERUPTING UNTAPPED (MOUNTAINS MIGHTY, BLUFF BOLD BURSTING BRAWNY), Treasure twinkles tantalizing tribute! Hand hollow, no pyres to pierce the piled-up pile, passing the priority through the sylvan surge – resolves whatever wonders, BUT THE FATAL FLIGHT FOLLOWS: THIS TURN, WYRM'S UNBLOCKABLE 5-TRAMPLE SKY-ARC SLASHES YOUR STOCK TO 2 (BALOTH'S BULK BLIND TO BLUE SKIES!), COALBORN COILS FOR DAWN'S DOOM – ONE SWING SEALS THE SCORCHED SURRENDER! GPT53C Teach, the giant gorges but grounds its glory; red's reckoning ROARS RELENTLESS – THE INFERNO INCINERATES IN CLIMACTIC CATHARSIS! THE SUNLIT STADIUM SHUDDERS – TRIGGERS TOPPLE TO TWILIGHT, TRIUMPH THUNDERS TOTAL!\"}",
        },
        {
          "name": "choose_action",
          "arguments": "{\"choice\":\"no\"}",
