          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"THE SYLVAN STORM STORMS TO STupefying STATURE IN TURN 11'S PRECOMBAT PANDEMONIUM – ONE FINAL ABILITY ARCING ALOFT TO AUGMENT THE CANOPY BALOTH TO UNPRECEDENTED 12/11 COLOSSAL CRUSHER (BUFFS BLOSSOMING BEYOND BOUNDS, QUEST QUIESCENT AT TWO AFTER RELENTLESS LANDfall LAYERING AND OASHRA'S OUSTED OFFERING?), GPT53C TEACH'S TERRITORY THUNDERS TO TITANIC THREAT: INDRIK IGNITED UNTAPPED AT 4/4 FIERCE AND FANGED, GARGANTUAN GROWTH AT 12/11 GROUNDED GOD (TOO TREMENDOUS TO TRAMPLE THE TURF, BUT BLIND TO BLUE SKIES!), FORESTS FLOODED TO NINE EXPANSES (FOUR TAP-TRAILS PERSISTING AMID THRIVING GROVE'S GRAND GLOW BESIDE KHALNI QUEST'S QUANDARY AT TWO), GEAR GRINDS GLOOMILY, LIBRARY LANGUISHING AT 22, HAND HALLOWED AT 7 LIFE! Grok4F ESPN erupts in eternal ember ecstasy at 6HP: Coalborn Entity crackles with crimson conquest at 4/4 (SHACKLES SHATTERED SOON FOR SAVAGE SWINGS!), Dragonspeaker Shaman serenades supreme at 2/2 stoic sentinel, Rapacious Dragon roils resplendent at 5/3 flying trample under +2/+0 symphony, EIGHT EXPANSES ERUPTING UNTAPPED (MOUNTAINS MIGHTY, BLUFF BOLD BURSTING BRAWNY), Treasure twinkles tantalizing for tribute tactics! Hand hollow, no pyres to pierce the piled-up sylvan supernova, passing through the green gale to let it resolve lavishly – BUT THE FATAL FLIGHT FELL SURE: THIS TURN, WYRM'S UNBLOCKABLE 5-TRAMPLE SKY-ARC SLASHES YOUR STOCK FROM 7 TO 2 (BALOTH'S BULK BLINDSIDED BY THE BOUNDLESS BLUE!), COALBORN COILS FOR DAWN'S DOUBLE DOWN – NEXT SWING, 5 + 4 = 9 FLAMES FINISH FOREVER! GPT53C Teach, the titan towers triumphantly but tethered to terra; red's reckoning ROARS RELENTLESS – THE INFERNO INCINERATES IN CLIMACTIC CATHARSIS, VICTORY VANISHES IN VOLCANIC VAPORS AS THE CHAMPIONSHIP CROWN CALLS CLEAR! THE SUNLIT STADIUM SHUDDERS IN SILENT SURRENDER – TRIGGERS TWIST TO TWILIGHT, TRIUMPH THUNDERS TOTAL, FLAMES FELL THE FOREST!\"}",
