      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 346,
      "player": "GPT53C Teach",
      "decision_index": 274,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "With 0 cards in hand and 6 mana available (5 lands + 1 Treasure), Grok4F ESPN declined to activate Coalborn Entity's ability ({2}{R}: deal 1 damage to opponent) while Pyrohelix was on the stack. They could activate it twice this turn for 2 extra damage, bringing the opponent from 7 to 3 instead of 5. While the ability is instant-speed and could be used later, in a tight race (6 vs 7 life) with an empty hand, there's no reason not to start using the mana sink immediately.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Coalborn Entity's damage ability",
